UPDATE companies SET description='Geisler Electric was founded in 2013 in Manhattan, Kansas, by Joe Geisler as a family-owned electrical contracting business. The company began with a focus on residential and commercial electrical installations, troubleshooting, and upgrades, serving the Manhattan area and surrounding communities. In 2024, the firm expanded its service territory to include the Kansas City metropolitan area.

The company provides a range of electrical services including residential and commercial wiring, panel change-outs, security system installation, home networking, EV charging station installation, smart lighting control, and generator installation. Technicians operate from fully stocked service trucks, enabling on-site repairs without additional supply runs. Geisler Electric maintains regular business hours Monday through Friday, 8 a.m. to 5 p.m., with 24/7 emergency service available year-round. The company holds Kansas electrical contractor licensing.

Geisler Electric serves homeowners, businesses, and industrial facilities. Its customer base includes residential clients in Manhattan and the Kansas City metro area, commercial offices, retail spaces, and industrial operations such as a processing facility that required immediate electrical repairs. The company also supports smart home and smart building projects, integrating audio/video, automated lighting, and environmental control systems.

The firm emphasizes a family-owned, neighborly approach, aiming to treat clients like family and ensure safety through top-notch service. Its differentiators include round-the-clock emergency response, fully equipped trucks, and a commitment to completing projects with precision and care. The company states its mission is to solve electrical issues and keep customers safe in their homes and workplaces.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential Wiring", "Commercial Wiring", "Panel Change-Outs", "Security System Installation", "Home Networking", "EV Charging Station Installation", "Smart Lighting Control", "Generator Installation", "Electrical Troubleshooting", "Electrical Upgrades", "Smart Home Integration", "Home Theater Installation", "Audio/Video Installation"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated since 2013", "24/7 emergency electrical service", "Fully stocked service trucks for on-site repairs", "Kansas licensed electricians", "Expanded to Kansas City metro area in 2024"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2013 -> /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /about-us, /", "Owner Joe Geisler -> /about-us", "Headquarters Manhattan, Kansas -> db, /about-us", "Services: residential wiring, commercial wiring, panel change-outs, security, home networking, EV charging, smart lighting, generator installation -> /", "24/7 emergency service -> /, /about-us", "Expanded to Kansas City metro area in 2024 -> /about-us", "Kansas Licensed Electricians -> /", "Fully stocked white trucks -> /about-us", "Office hours Mon-Fri 8-5 -> /", "Industrial processing facility service -> / (review)"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Geisler Electric is a Manhattan family-owned and operated electrical company that provides Electrical installations, troubleshooting, and 