UPDATE companies SET description='Global Textile Alliance, Inc. (GTA USA) was founded in 2001 in Reidsville, North Carolina, by principals who each brought two decades of textile and bedding industry experience. The company was established to serve the bedding and furniture markets from a global perspective, leveraging a heritage that traces back to a Belgian weaving mill with fabric production knowledge since 1953.

The Reidsville facility operates as a vertical mill, integrating warping, weaving, circular knitting, and finishing under one roof. In-house yarn extrusion produces ecological yarns, while fabric formation technology and a quality-control lab support the development of mattress, upholstery, and curtain fabrics. Design, development, and sales teams collaborate on site, using trend research to create unique constructions, patterns, and colorations for brands including GTA USA, Ter Molst, and Symphony Mills—all part of the Love Home Fabrics group.

Its customer base includes manufacturers seeking domestic capacity with the flexibility to adjust to changing requirements, backed by global sourcing capabilities that mirror the company''s European and Indian sister operations.

