UPDATE companies SET description='Grand Rapids Chair Company operates from Byron Center, Michigan, where it was founded in 1991 as Manufacturer''s Resource by Dave and Jill Miller. The company was renamed Grand Rapids Chair Company, and Geoff assumed leadership in 2012, growing the team to nearly 150 employees.

